9983215332]]}], "text": "Here's a summary of the session notes in 8 bullet points:\n\n- **Scope & context:** A two-part rebuild series of the `llama.cpp-sycl-f16-git` AUR package (Raudbjorn fork) on host `vinbonesjr` (Ryzen 7900X3D, Intel Arc A770 16GB), spanning commits b10146\u2192b12321 across 2026-09-26 to 2026-10-01, split between Context A (Claude Opus 5.5) and Context B (Claude Sonnet 5.5, resumed).\n\n- **Major technical work:** The session addressed a PKGBUILD rework, an LLAMA_SUBPROCESS ABI compatibility trap (commit d37dd50bb), SYCL graph optimizations, a oneDNN A/B comparison, a oneAPI 2026.0\u21922026.1 upgrade (DLE swap), PR #63 benchmark review, an IGC crash fix for DG2 XMX-gather (commit 4e7400c3a), 256-GRF kernels, and a 12-vs-18 tokens/second decode investigation.\n\n- **Driver transition:** The Intel Arc A770 switched from the i915 driver (kernel 7.3.0-rc1) to the **xe** driver (kernel 7.3.0-rc5) between the two contexts\u2014this switch was performed by other sessions, not this one.\n\n- **Final state:** The package was rebuilt, installed, and placed into production with a systemd service; the working directory used branch `feature/raudbjorn-fork-arc-tuning`, and all"}